":"/en-2022/udilo-aruna-puraba-bhage/","title":"Aruṇodoya-kīrtan 1"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":52,"first_line":"gurudeva! kṛpā-bindu diyā, kara’ ei dāse","author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"},"title":["Gurudeva"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["gurudeva!","kṛpā-bindu diyā,    kara’ ei dāse,","    tṛṇāpekṣā ati dīna","sakala-sahane,    bala diyā kara,","    nija-māne spṛhā-hīna"],"translation":["Gurudeva, give to this servant just one drop of mercy. I am lower than a blade of grass. Give me all help. Give me strength. Let me be as you are, without desires or aspirations."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["sakale sammān,    korite śakati,","    deho nātha! yathā yatha","tobe to’ gāibo,    harināma-sukhe,","    aparādha hobe hoto"],"translation":["Give me energy so that I can properly give respect and honour to all. Then I shall be able to happily chant the Holy Name, and my offences will go away."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["kobe heno kṛpā,    lobhiyā e jana,","    kṛtārtha hoibe, nātha!","śakti-buddhi-hīn,    āmi ati dīn,","    kara more ātma-sātha"],"translation":["Oh my Lord! When will such mercy fall to this person. I am weak, bereft, and devoid of intelligence. Please allow me to be with you."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["jogyatā-vichāre,    kichu nāhi pāi,","    tomāra karuṇā-sāra","karuṇā nā hoile,    kā̐diyā kā̐diyā,","    prāṇa nā rākhibo āra"],"translation":["If you examine me, you will find no qualities. Your mercy is everything to me. If you are not merciful unto me, I can only weep, and I will not be able to maintain my life."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sridhar-maharaj-and-govinda-6","personSlug":"srila-b-r-sridhar-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-gurudev-kripa","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-gurudev-morning","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-gurudev","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-utrennee-2","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/43-gurudeva-krpa-bindu-diya","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/gurudev-kripa-bindu-diya","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-gurudev","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/gurudeva-kripa-bindu-diya-kara-ei-dase/","description":"Gurudeva — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Gurudeva. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"gurudeva-kripa-bindu-diya-kara-ei-dase"}}